{"page":66,"width":1884,"height":2807,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.1 프로세스 개념","words":[{"text":"3.1","x":1303,"y":174,"width":49,"height":23},{"text":"프로세스","x":1370,"y":174,"width":99,"height":26},{"text":"개념","x":1479,"y":174,"width":48,"height":28}]},{"text":"테스트 섹션 - 실행 코드","words":[{"text":"테스트","x":380,"y":306,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"섹션","x":494,"y":308,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"-","x":572,"y":327,"width":39,"height":7},{"text":"실행","x":626,"y":309,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"코드","x":705,"y":314,"width":66,"height":28}]},{"text":"• 데이터 세션- 전역 변수","words":[{"text":"•","x":337,"y":390,"width":15,"height":16},{"text":"데이터","x":381,"y":380,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"세션-","x":494,"y":381,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"전역","x":626,"y":383,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"변수","x":707,"y":384,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"• 힘 섹션 - 프로그람} 실행 중에 동적으로 할당되는 메모리","words":[{"text":"•","x":337,"y":464,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"힘","x":379,"y":454,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"섹션","x":424,"y":454,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"-","x":503,"y":474,"width":40,"height":5},{"text":"프로그람}","x":556,"y":456,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"실행","x":705,"y":457,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"중에","x":782,"y":456,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"동적으로","x":862,"y":456,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"할당되는","x":1012,"y":455,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"메모리","x":1162,"y":455,"width":97,"height":38}]},{"text":"119","words":[{"text":"119","x":1605,"y":169,"width":58,"height":29}]},{"text":"• 스택 섹션 - 함수를 호출할 때 임시 데이터 저장장소(예: 함수 매개변수, 복귀 주소","words":[{"text":"•","x":336,"y":538,"width":15,"height":15},{"text":"스택","x":377,"y":528,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"섹션","x":459,"y":528,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"-","x":538,"y":548,"width":40,"height":4},{"text":"함수를","x":592,"y":529,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"호출할","x":706,"y":530,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"때","x":822,"y":529,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"임시","x":869,"y":530,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"데이터","x":950,"y":530,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"저장장소(예:","x":1066,"y":530,"width":189,"height":43},{"text":"함수","x":1271,"y":531,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"매개변수,","x":1354,"y":532,"width":147,"height":40},{"text":"복귀","x":1516,"y":533,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"주소","x":1600,"y":534,"width":71,"height":37}]},{"text":"및 지역 변수)","words":[{"text":"및","x":379,"y":590,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"지역","x":424,"y":590,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"변수)","x":505,"y":591,"width":76,"height":41}]},{"text":"텍스트 및 데이터 섹션의 그기는 고정되기 때문에 프로그램 실행 시간 동안 크기가","words":[{"text":"텍스트","x":377,"y":720,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"및","x":494,"y":719,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"데이터","x":542,"y":719,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"섹션의","x":656,"y":720,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"그기는","x":772,"y":720,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"고정되기","x":890,"y":722,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"때문에","x":1043,"y":722,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램","x":1158,"y":724,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"실행","x":1311,"y":724,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"시간","x":1395,"y":725,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"동안","x":1478,"y":725,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"크기가","x":1564,"y":726,"width":106,"height":39}]},{"text":"변하지 않는다. 그러나 스택 및 힘 섹션은 프로그램 실행 중에 동적으로 줄어들거나 커","words":[{"text":"변하지","x":313,"y":784,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"않는다.","x":428,"y":783,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":554,"y":783,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"스택","x":672,"y":784,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"및","x":757,"y":784,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"힘","x":805,"y":784,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"섹션은","x":853,"y":784,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램","x":972,"y":786,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"실행","x":1123,"y":787,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"중에","x":1205,"y":788,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"동적으로","x":1289,"y":789,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"줄어들거나","x":1444,"y":789,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"커","x":1636,"y":791,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"질 수 있다. 함수가 호출될 때마다 함수 매개변수, 지역 변수 및 복귀 주소를 포함하는","words":[{"text":"질","x":312,"y":848,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":358,"y":849,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":411,"y":847,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"함수가","x":502,"y":847,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"호출될","x":619,"y":848,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"때마다","x":740,"y":848,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"함수","x":858,"y":849,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"매개변수,","x":944,"y":850,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"지역","x":1106,"y":851,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"변수","x":1191,"y":852,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":1275,"y":852,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"복귀","x":1323,"y":852,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"주소를","x":1408,"y":853,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"포함하는","x":1529,"y":853,"width":140,"height":38}]},{"text":"활성화 레코드(activation record)가 스택에 푸시 된다. 함수에서 제어가 되돌아오면 스","words":[{"text":"활성화","x":309,"y":913,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"레코드(activation","x":424,"y":912,"width":284,"height":42},{"text":"record)가","x":722,"y":913,"width":163,"height":41},{"text":"스택에","x":897,"y":915,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"푸시","x":1012,"y":915,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":1093,"y":915,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"함수에서","x":1182,"y":915,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"제어가","x":1333,"y":916,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"되돌아오면","x":1449,"y":916,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"스","x":1635,"y":920,"width":34,"height":28}]},{"text":"택에서 활성화 레코드가 팝 된다. 마찬가지로 메모리가 동적으로 할당됨에 따라 힘이 커","words":[{"text":"택에서","x":310,"y":977,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"활성화","x":423,"y":976,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"레코드가","x":541,"y":977,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"팝","x":690,"y":977,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":738,"y":978,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"마찬가지로","x":830,"y":978,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"메모리가","x":1019,"y":979,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"동적으로","x":1166,"y":979,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"할당됨에","x":1317,"y":979,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"따라","x":1469,"y":979,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"힘이","x":1554,"y":980,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"커","x":1638,"y":981,"width":27,"height":37}]},{"text":"지고 메모리가 시스템에 반환되면 축소된다. 스택 및 힘 섹션이 서로의 방향으로 커지더","words":[{"text":"지고","x":310,"y":1042,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"메모리가","x":389,"y":1041,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"시스템에","x":539,"y":1042,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"반환되면","x":690,"y":1042,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"축소된다.","x":841,"y":1043,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"스택","x":1005,"y":1044,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"및","x":1089,"y":1044,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"힘","x":1134,"y":1043,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"섹션이","x":1182,"y":1043,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"서로의","x":1297,"y":1043,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"방향으로","x":1416,"y":1043,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"커지더","x":1568,"y":1043,"width":98,"height":39}]},{"text":"라도 운영체제는 서로 겹치지 않도록 해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"라도","x":309,"y":1107,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"운영체제는","x":386,"y":1106,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"서로","x":571,"y":1107,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"겹치지","x":652,"y":1107,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"않도록","x":769,"y":1108,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"해야","x":887,"y":1108,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":968,"y":1109,"width":76,"height":38}]},{"text":"우리는 프로그램 그 자체는 프로세스가 아님을 강조한다. 프로그램은 명령어 리스","words":[{"text":"우리는","x":370,"y":1172,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램","x":489,"y":1173,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":643,"y":1178,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"자체는","x":694,"y":1172,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":816,"y":1173,"width":178,"height":39},{"text":"아님을","x":1009,"y":1173,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"강조한다.","x":1130,"y":1173,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램은","x":1292,"y":1173,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"명령어","x":1485,"y":1173,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"리스","x":1606,"y":1173,"width":67,"height":39}]},{"text":"드를 내용으로 가진 디스크에 저장된 파일(실행 파일이라고 불림)과 같은 수동적인 존재","words":[{"text":"드를","x":310,"y":1239,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"내용으로","x":389,"y":1237,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"가진","x":538,"y":1238,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"디스크에","x":620,"y":1238,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"저장된","x":772,"y":1238,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"파일(실행","x":890,"y":1238,"width":150,"height":43},{"text":"파일이라고","x":1056,"y":1238,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"불림)과","x":1241,"y":1237,"width":117,"height":43},{"text":"같은","x":1371,"y":1238,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"수동적인","x":1451,"y":1238,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"존재","x":1604,"y":1239,"width":66,"height":39}]},{"text":"(passive entity)이다. 이외는 대조적으로 프로세스는 다음에 실행할 명령어를 지정하","words":[{"text":"(passive","x":307,"y":1306,"width":141,"height":41},{"text":"entity)이다.","x":465,"y":1304,"width":191,"height":45},{"text":"이외는","x":677,"y":1304,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"대조적으로","x":798,"y":1304,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스는","x":989,"y":1304,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"다음에","x":1178,"y":1303,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"실행할","x":1298,"y":1303,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"명령어를","x":1417,"y":1303,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"지정하","x":1571,"y":1304,"width":104,"height":40}]},{"text":"는 프로그램 카운터와 관련 자원의 집합을 가진 능동적인 존재(active entity)이다. 실","words":[{"text":"는","x":306,"y":1370,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램","x":354,"y":1369,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"카운터와","x":508,"y":1369,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"관련","x":660,"y":1369,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"자원의","x":745,"y":1369,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"집합을","x":868,"y":1369,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"가진","x":988,"y":1369,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"능동적인","x":1071,"y":1369,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"존재(active","x":1225,"y":1369,"width":189,"height":41},{"text":"entity)이다.","x":1429,"y":1370,"width":193,"height":45},{"text":"실","x":1640,"y":1371,"width":32,"height":38}]},{"text":"행 파일이 메모리에 적재될 때 프로그램은 프로세스가 된다. 실행 파일을 메모리에 적재","words":[{"text":"행","x":307,"y":1434,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"파일이","x":352,"y":1434,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"메모리에","x":470,"y":1435,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"적재될","x":622,"y":1434,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"때","x":739,"y":1435,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램은","x":786,"y":1435,"width":177,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":976,"y":1435,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":1164,"y":1435,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"실행","x":1256,"y":1434,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"파일을","x":1336,"y":1435,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"메모리에","x":1454,"y":1435,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"적재","x":1606,"y":1437,"width":64,"height":40}]},{"text":"하는 일반적인 두 가지 방식은 실행 파일을 나타내는 아이콘을 더블 클릭하는 방식과 명","words":[{"text":"하는","x":307,"y":1499,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"일반적인","x":389,"y":1499,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":536,"y":1502,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":585,"y":1500,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"방식은","x":667,"y":1499,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"실행","x":785,"y":1500,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"파일을","x":868,"y":1501,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"나타내는","x":988,"y":1500,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"아이콘을","x":1141,"y":1501,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"더블","x":1292,"y":1500,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"클릭하는","x":1371,"y":1501,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"방식과","x":1522,"y":1502,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"명","x":1639,"y":1504,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"령어 라인상에서 prog• exe 또는 a•out과 같이 파일 이름을 입력하는 방식이다.","words":[{"text":"령어","x":309,"y":1564,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"라인상에서","x":387,"y":1565,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"prog•","x":568,"y":1578,"width":97,"height":29},{"text":"exe","x":675,"y":1578,"width":59,"height":20},{"text":"또는","x":749,"y":1568,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"a•out과","x":834,"y":1567,"width":142,"height":38},{"t